{"id":"e3eceeac-c0cd-484e-80cf-0dd525880d75","createdAt":"2026-10-26T11:59:08.901Z","batchId":"pricing_glm-5-3-flash-gateway_high","approach":"html","modelId":"glm-5.3-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"high"},"presetId":"pricing","prompt":"A pricing page with three plans (Free, Pro, Team), their features and a call to action for each.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<main class=\"page\">\n  <header class=\"stack center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Pricing</span>\n    <h1>Simple plans that scale with you</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Start free, upgrade when you need more. Every plan includes unlimited projects, SSL, and community support.</p>\n    <div class=\"row center gap-sm\" style=\"justify-content:center\">\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"billing\" value=\"monthly\" checked> Monthly</label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"billing\" value=\"yearly\"> Yearly <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Save up to 20%</span></label>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"grid cols-3 gap-lg\">\n    <article class=\"card stack\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3>Free</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted small\">For hobby projects and trying things out.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row baseline gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"stat-value\" data-price data-monthly=\"0\" data-yearly=\"0\">$0</span>\n        <span class=\"muted small\">/ month</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"muted small\" data-note data-monthly=\"No credit card required.\" data-yearly=\"Free forever — no credit card required.\">No credit card required.</p>\n      <ul class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0\">\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm small\">✓ 1 workspace, 2 seats</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm small\">✓ 5 GB storage</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm small\">✓ 10,000 API calls / month</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm small\">✓ Community support</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm small muted\">✗ Custom domains</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm small muted\">✗ Audit logs</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:auto\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block\" data-plan=\"Free\">Get started free</button>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"card stack\" style=\"border-color:var(--primary,#6366f1)\">\n      <div class=\"row between center\">\n        <h3 style=\"margin:0\">Pro</h3>\n        <span class=\"badge\">Most popular</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"muted small\">For freelancers and solo builders shipping to production.</p>\n      <div class=\"row baseline gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"stat-value\" data-price data-monthly=\"12\" data-yearly=\"10\">$12</span>\n        <span class=\"muted small\">/ month</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"muted small\" data-note data-monthly=\"Billed monthly. Cancel anytime.\" data-yearly=\"Billed yearly — $120/yr, save $24.\">Billed monthly. Cancel anytime.</p>\n      <ul class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0\">\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm small\">✓ Unlimited workspaces &amp; seats</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm small\">✓ 100 GB storage</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm small\">✓ 1,000,000 API calls / month</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm small\">✓ Custom domains &amp; SSL</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm small\">✓ Email support (24h response)</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm small muted\">✗ Audit logs</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:auto\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-block\" data-plan=\"Pro\">Start 14-day Pro trial</button>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"card stack\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3>Team</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted small\">For teams that need collaboration, control, and compliance.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row baseline gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"stat-value\" data-price data-monthly=\"29\" data-yearly=\"24\">$29</span>\n        <span class=\"muted small\">/ user / month</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"muted small\" data-note data-monthly=\"Minimum 3 users.\" data-yearly=\"Billed yearly — $288/user/yr, save $60 per user.\">Minimum 3 users.</p>\n      <ul class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0\">\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm small\">✓ Everything in Pro</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm small\">✓ 1 TB shared storage</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm small\">✓ Unlimited API calls</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm small\">✓ Audit logs &amp; role-based access</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm small\">✓ SSO (SAML / OIDC)</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm small\">✓ Priority support &amp; 99.9% SLA</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:auto\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block\" data-plan=\"Team\">Contact sales</button>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card\">\n    <h3 class=\"card-title\">Feature comparison</h3>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">A quick side-by-side of what each plan unlocks.</p>\n    <div style=\"overflow-x:auto\">\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr><th>Feature</th><th>Free</th><th>Pro</th><th>Team</th></tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>Seats</td><td class=\"num\">2</td><td class=\"num\">Unlimited</td><td class=\"num\">Unlimited</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Storage</td><td class=\"num\">5 GB</td><td class=\"num\">100 GB</td><td class=\"num\">1 TB</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>API calls / month</td><td class=\"num\">10k</td><td class=\"num\">1M</td><td class=\"num\">Unlimited</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Custom domains</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"badge\">✓</span></td><td><span class=\"badge\">✓</span></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Audit logs</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"badge\">✓</span></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>SSO (SAML / OIDC)</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"badge\">✓</span></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Support</td><td>Community</td><td>Email, 24h</td><td>Priority + SLA</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"alert\" id=\"cta-feedback\" hidden></div>\n\n  <script>\n    (function () {\n      var radios = document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"billing\"]');\n      var feedback = document.getElementById('cta-feedback');\n\n      function setBilling(mode) {\n        document.querySelectorAll('[data-price]').forEach(function (el) {\n          el.textContent = '$' + el.getAttribute('data-' + mode);\n        });\n        document.querySelectorAll('[data-note]').forEach(function (el) {\n          el.textContent = el.getAttribute('data-' + mode);\n        });\n      }\n      radios.forEach(function (r) {\n        r.addEventListener('change', function () { if (r.checked) setBilling(r.value); });\n      });\n\n      document.querySelectorAll('[data-plan]').forEach(function (btn) {\n        btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n          var plan = btn.getAttribute('data-plan');\n          var mode = document.querySelector('input[name=\"billing\"]:checked').value;\n          feedback.hidden = false;\n          if (plan === 'Team') {\n            feedback.textContent = 'Thanks! Our sales team will reach out about the Team plan within one business day.';\n          } else {\n            feedback.textContent = plan + ' plan selected (' + mode + ' billing). Check your inbox to confirm your account.';\n          }\n        });\n      });\n    })();\n  </script>\n</main>","deltas":[[8434,"<main"],[8434," class"],[8434,"=\""],[8434,"page"],[8434,"\">\n"],[8434," "],[8434," <"],[8434,"header"],[8434," class"],[8434,"=\""],[8434,"stack"],[8437," center"],[8437,"\""],[8437," style"],[8437,"=\""],[8437,"text"],[8437,"-align"],[8437,":center"],[8437,"\">\n"],[8437,"   "],[8437," <"],[8437,"span"],[8437," class"],[8437,"=\""],[8437,"badge"],[8437," badge"],[8437,"-outline"],[8437,"\">"],[8437,"P"],[8437,"ricing"],[8437,"</span"],[8437,">\n"],[8437,"   "],[8444," <"],[8444,"h"],[8444,"1"],[8444,">"],[8444,"Simple"],[8444," plans"],[8444," that"],[8444," scale"],[8444," with"],[8444," you"],[8444,"</h"],[8444,"1"],[8444,">\n"],[8444,"   "],[8444," <"],[8446,"p"],[8446," class"],[8446,"=\""],[8446,"lead"],[8446,"\">"],[8446,"Start"],[8446," free"],[8469,","],[8469," upgrade"],[8469," when"],[8469," you"],[8469," need"],[8469," more"],[8469,"."],[8469," Every"],[8469," plan"],[8469," includes"],[8469," unlimited"],[8469," projects"],[8469,","],[8469," SSL"],[8469,","],[9607," and"],[9607," community"],[9607," support"],[9607,".</"],[9607,"p"],[9607,">\n"],[9607,"   "],[9607," <"],[9607,"div"],[9607," class"],[9607,"=\""],[9607,"row"],[9607," center"],[9607," gap"],[9607,"-sm"],[9607,"\""],[9607," style"],[9607,"=\""],[9607,"justify"],[9607,"-content"],[9607,":center"],[9607,"\">\n"],[9615,"     "],[9615," <"],[9615,"label"],[9615," class"],[9615,"=\""],[9615,"check"],[9615,"\"><"],[9615,"input"],[9615," type"],[9615,"=\""],[9615,"radio"],[9615,"\""],[9615," name"],[9615,"=\""],[9615,"billing"],[9615,"\""],[9615," value"],[9615,"=\""],[9615,"monthly"],[9615,"\""],[9615," checked"],[9615,">"],[9619," Monthly"],[9619,"</label"],[9619,">\n"],[9619,"     "],[9619," <"],[9619,"label"],[9619," class"],[9